findings.evidence:
The data exists but is never projected forward:
- ageing buckets (engine.ts:868), payments with dates and methods (engine.ts:532-555), invoice due_date, purchase bills;
- stock movements with dates (engine.ts:461-466, 483-485), but reorder alerts are a fixed threshold (engine.ts:694-707);
- lead scoring is hand-set points (packs.ts:153-160) with no learning from won/lost outcomes, although stageHistory and won/lost stage types are recorded (engine.ts:313-327).
